{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/GlobalIdentifier"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/globalidentifier\/storeuri"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The local object’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSManagedObjectID"},{"text":" URI — the essential mapping from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this global identifier to its row in THIS device’s persistent store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used by integration to locate the object for incoming changes.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}],"title":"storeURI","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:9Ensembles16GlobalIdentifierV8storeURISSSgvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"storeURI","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"storeURI","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Device-local by design: it must never be synced, exported, or adopted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from another device’s data. Object URIs carry a store UUID and primary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key, so a foreign URI is meaningless here at best — and on a device","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restored from another device’s backup (matching store UUID) it can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resolve to the wrong object. Entries are disposable: a missing or stale","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URI is re-populated wherever the object surfaces next — attach import,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"save capture, or integration creating the object for an insert change.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(An update or delete change whose identifier has no usable URI is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"skipped for that pass, not re-resolved.)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/GlobalIdentifier\/storeURI"},"references":{"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/GlobalIdentifier/storeURI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/GlobalIdentifier\/storeURI","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/globalidentifier\/storeuri","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"storeURI"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"storeURI","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The local object’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSManagedObjectID"},{"type":"text","text":" URI — the essential mapping from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this global identifier to its row in THIS device’s persistent store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"used by integration to locate the object for incoming changes.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/GlobalIdentifier":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GlobalIdentifier","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A globally uniqu